{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_07_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_07","title":"地堡防線","storyCode":"OD-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f93c010fe286abad41a819332a0bc4cc5fbe7d3cc3d1bce097fd45b1ee9d72ae","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"虹彩小隊決定一勞永逸的解決長泉鎮的危機。在部署了戰術之後，他們兵分兩路，由幹員Ash帶隊消滅礦坑裡的災難源頭。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混帳東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"頭兒，我覺得還是先撤吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤？我可還沒輸呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領主衛隊已經死光了，我只需要等待下一波反攻的時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾個羅德島的傭兵，不是我的對手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個科學家呢?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼一個人都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"看著他的人去哪兒了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來情況不是很順利啊，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我猜猜看，就算是帶著我強而有力的造物，你還是沒有成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話我真的一點都不感到意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有那麼多時間聽你陰陽怪氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼依據你以往的風格，你又要更新的玩具，難怪你的父親不喜歡你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話，我現在需要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和我說話嗎，先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你至少要加上“請”這個字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在求我幫你，你這是求人的態度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在耍我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起來像是在開玩笑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的，這個老東西，你找打。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼！這是什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我的頭！我的頭要炸了......我的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！你做了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這類打手啊，除了一身蠻力，真的是什麼素質都不具備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，先生，你真的以為，就靠這麼幾個智力低下的蠢貨，就能把科學困在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去，讓我們的贊助商大老爺冷靜點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸變體感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸變體感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認不得了？這是你的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，現在它們更厲害了，也更聽話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上你也會加入它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你可以操縱這些怪物，你明明不會源石技藝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有源石技藝才可以操縱它們？你們這些人思維如此狹隘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有思考過為什麼所謂的“源石技藝”可以控制“感染生物”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，以你的智商無法得出這個問題的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要成為它們的一部分，你自然就能和這些生物溝通，我們相處得很融洽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是個無藥可救的瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是圖拉家族的人，我繼承了圖拉家族的神民血脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢在巴耶勒王酋的領土上謀殺貴族，你找死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王酋？貴族？血脈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有幽默感，德魯奇先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這個笑話有點過時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我不曾鄙夷豬玀，唯獨憎惡高掛枝頭的金冠。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的祖國，人們燒死了主教，吊死了國王，砍了皇帝的腦袋，將舊日的一切權貴砸得稀爛，不會有人再懼怕所謂的王侯貴族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼王酋，什麼血脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我眼裡屁都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這身臭皮囊，還不如那些礦石病患者有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把那些礦石病患者叫作什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者能為我的實驗做出貢獻，而你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身份毫無意義，你的短視讓我瞠目結舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無能的廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你這種卑劣愚蠢的壞東西，居然還自稱“貴族”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼“高貴過人”的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也不用擔心，我和你的腐朽觀念很不一樣......我是一位科學家，我追求的是客觀存在的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學對所有人都很公平，不會因為你的出身而改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族、平民，當你躺在手術台上，當柳葉刀劃開皮膚，所有人的價值和貢獻都是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你的個人案例裡，當你獻身科學時，你可能會比現在要略微更加高貴一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該感到榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個可恥的叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒？叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你向你的親妹妹下黑手，背叛了自己的家人。你勾結外國的雇傭兵掠奪你父親的財富，你背叛了生你養你的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然還有臉面說我是叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑不了的，你根本不知道我背後這群人的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這半年來所有的科研經費都是他們提供的，你現在想要背叛我，就是背叛了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾沃特科欽斯基的人是不會饒了你的，他們會找到你，他們會殺了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑不掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會妥善處理這個問題的，不需要你來操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，蠢貨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是什麼打扮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我從領主的倉庫裡找到的，看起來還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"......很適合你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我聽過的最瘋狂的作戰計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來倒是有點說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道製造源石爆炸就能把這些怪物從地裡引出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"只能說多虧了醫生，我才意識到這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物們一直以來都服從術師的指示，只有那天晚上是個例外。我意識到，那一夜，失控的怪物們其實是在追逐四散飛濺的源石碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就認定這件事一定能成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也只是賭一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這台源石引擎你們是從哪兒搞來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個......之前發生了很多事情，總之我們弄來了一輛車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這車可有點眼熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這輛車是不是我們丟的那輛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今就不要計較這種小事了，哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那礦坑的部分呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我們抓住的那個雇傭兵基本上什麼都招了，你弟弟製造怪物的工廠就在礦洞深處。我甚至覺得他可能還沒放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡把怪物引出來，寇恩就有機會帶人下去把礦洞炸它個底朝天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來可是一點都不簡單......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這個計劃聽起來充滿大量意外，而且一點都不嚴謹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我喜歡這種計劃，戰鬥就是唯一的解決方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然巡林者老先生都這麼說了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，朋友們——各就各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這個計劃起作用了，點燃源石引擎之後，必然會有大量的怪物衝上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一場苦戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感謝羅德島的各位......選擇留下來幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用客氣，清理污染生物也是我的本職工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份工作沒有工資哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好煩啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你們......我不知道該怎麼向你們表達感謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"道謝的話，還是留到後面再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"好，如果各位沒有更多問題的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也太多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"這有多少隻？上百隻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不，可能不止......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"不......還有更多在後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"只能希望寇恩他們一切順利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["FROST"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["TACHANKA"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
